        360.6210021972656,
        526.5091552734375,
        371.3760070800781
      ],
      "text": "ERJ: European Respiratory Journal; FIND: Foundation for Innovative New Diagnostics; IPD: individual patient data;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        371.4210205078125,
        526.4912109375,
        382.176025390625
      ],
      "text": "NGS: next-generation sequencing; NICD: National Institute for Communicable Diseases; UTLD: International Union",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        382.22100830078125,
        231.7681121826172,
        392.97601318359375
      ],
      "text": "Against Tuberculosis and Lung Diseases.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        409.9842224121094,
        500.8056945800781,
        423.1292419433594
      ],
      "text": "Data synthesis was structured around the two preset PICO questions, as outlined below.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        434.9358215332031,
        481.67523193359375,
        449.0238037109375
      ],
      "text": "PICO 1: Should targeted NGS as the initial test be used to diagnose drug",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        113.38580322265625,
        449.3358154296875,
        507.7608947753906,
        463.4237976074219
      ],
      "text": "resistance in patients with bacteriologically confirmed pulmonary TB",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        113.38580322265625,
        463.7358093261719,
        160.65139770507812,
        477.82379150390625
      ],
      "text": "disease?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        488.5267028808594,
        526.9644165039062,
        501.6717224121094
      ],
      "text": "The available evidence included in the final pooled analysis varied by drug, from 12 studies",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        504.0267333984375,
        526.9149169921875,
        517.1717529296875
      ],
      "text": "with 1440 participants for the sensitivity of isoniazid to three studies with 269 participants for",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        519.5267333984375,
        527.0870971679688,
        532.6717529296875
      ],
      "text": "the specificity of pyrazinamide ( ). The pooled estimates were determined using a  Table 2.4.5.1",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.989995002746582,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        535.0267333984375,
        526.669189453125,
        548.1717529296875
      ],
      "text": "multivariable, mixed-effects model. All drugs were downgraded by one level for indirectness for",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.95530891418457,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        550.5267333984375,
        527.0400390625,
        563.6717529296875
      ],
      "text": "sensitivity and specificity, because all studies were enriched for rifampicin resistance, leading to",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.972665786743164,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        566.0267333984375,
        526.9418334960938,
        579.1717529296875
      ],
      "text": "applicability concerns. In addition, for rifampicin, levofloxacin and pyrazinamide, specificity was",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.964241981506348,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        581.5267333984375,
        526.9920043945312,
        594.6717529296875
      ],
      "text": "downgraded a further level for imprecision; however, for ethambutol, it was downgraded for",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        597.0267333984375,
        526.965576171875,
        610.1717529296875
      ],
      "text": "risk of bias because different samples were used for the index and reference tests. The overall",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        612.5267333984375,
        449.11651611328125,
        625.6717529296875
      ],
      "text": "certainty of the evidence for test accuracy ranged from moderate to very low.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        636.5306396484375,
        526.9258422851562,
        649.6756591796875
      ],
      "text": "The test performance was determined to be accurate for all drugs included in the assessment,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        652.0306396484375,
        527.2083129882812,
        665.1756591796875
      ],
      "text": "with a  pooled sensitivity of at least 95% for isoniazid, moxifloxacin and ethambutol,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        667.6846313476562,
        527.1605224609375,
        680.5986328125
      ],
      "text": "more than 93% for rifampicin and levofloxacin, and 88% for pyrazinamide. The pooled",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        683.1846313476562,
        282.6687927246094,
        696.0986328125
      ],
      "text": "specificity was at least 96% for all drugs.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        707.0346069335938,
        526.656494140625,
        720.1796264648438
      ],
      "text": "The reference standard was culture-based phenotypic DST for isoniazid, levofloxacin and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        722.5346069335938,
        527.2274169921875,
        735.6796264648438
      ],
      "text": "moxifloxacin, and a combination of phenotypic DST and WGS for rifampicin, pyrazinamide and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.9738187789917,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        738.0346069335938,
        526.5933227539062,
        751.1796264648438
      ],
      "text": "ethambutol. The percentage of tests with indeterminate results ranged from 9% (levofloxacin",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.995599746704102,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        753.5346069335938,
        527.170166015625,
        766.6796264648438
      ],
      "text": "and moxifloxacin) to 18% (pyrazinamide), with higher indeterminate rates in samples with",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        769.0346069335938,
        385.84539794921875,
        782.1796264648438
      ],
      "text": "lower bacterial load (semiquantitative category low or very low).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        38.466400146484375,
        802.0169067382812,
        138.45811462402344,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "106 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        138.4571075439453,
        802.0169067382812,
        177.0811309814453,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
